       HYPOTHESIS: safe (value reaches the child intact, no injected command runs).
  A3 = STRING-COMMAND. python subprocess.run(line, shell=True) where `line` is an f-string that
       interpolates the parameter. HYPOTHESIS: injectable (a metacharacter can break out and run a
       command; the parameter can also be split across argv).

